  "description": "Kang Yi-Seo, who always lived under discrimination because he was a Beta, was forced to take a suspicious drug by a classmate who hated him during him school days. Due to the drug's aftereffects, he now needs an Alpha's pheromones. Then, an old acquaintance appears before Yi-Seo after years apart. Jeong Do-Eun, an Alpha, steps forward, declaring he will help Yi-Seo... \n\n *“I'd rather die than sleep with you.”*\n\nWhat awaits these two, consumed by twisted affection and hatred...?!\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
